WEBVTT

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:07.730
Where am I?

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.880
What happened?

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:21.360
Ow...

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:27.630
<b><i>...and we come together, both of us,</i></b>

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:31.280
<b><i>our warmth and our everything</i></b>

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:33.300
<b><i>I don't need lies,</i></b>

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:37.640
<b><i>I don't need vague words,</i></b>

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:40.140
<b><i>Give it all to me</i></b>

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:44.450
<b><i>Even if I lose it all, I wouldn't care</i></b>

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:51.610
<b><i>So long as you're by my side</i></b>

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:55.920
<b><i>That would've been enough for me</i></b>

00:00:55.920 --> 00:01:00.910
<b><i>I look up at the sky alone</i></b>

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:34.670
Excuse me!

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:36.770
May I ask you something?

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:38.720
Hey! Could you tell me...

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:46.450
Who was the person on 
that screen up there?

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:50.310
Their song and dance was wonderful!

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:54.400
I want to sing and dance like that.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.520
No!  No!

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:03.350
I didn't mean that!

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:04.830
Wait...

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:11.670
Hey, let me join you!

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:14.540
I want to dance, too!

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:17.010
Sorry, that's impossible.

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:19.760
Why?  Why is it impossible?

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:23.910
I mean you're clearly no BK.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.390
BK?

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:28.010
If you're dressed like that,

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:30.140
you should go to the park plaza.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.980
How I'm dressed doesn't matter.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.120
What's important is what's inside.

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:40.780
There they are!

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:47.790
So what's your name?

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.120
Ieyasu.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:51.350
Ieyasu?

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:52.580
That's cool!

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:53.890
You think?

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:55.580
Then let's do it together!

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:56.570
Okay.

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:59.570
First we'll dance, so watch.

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:00.130
Okay.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:38.170
Huh?

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:42.880
Hey, why are you trying to
stand out from us?

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:45.110
Sorry.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.910
It was so fun I just...

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:49.140
Let me try again.

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:51.810
I don't think this is gonna work out.

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:56.500
If I can't dance...

00:04:58.150 --> 00:04:59.520
I can sing!

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:06.610
Don't try to stand out 
from the rest of us!

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:10.550
<i>Oh, happiness!  Happiness!</i>

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:11.660
<i>Oh, happiness!  Happineeeess!</i>

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:13.410
Don't just come in here!

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:16.500
<i>Shoo-shoo-shooby-doo-wah...</i>

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:16.500
<i>Lah-lahlah-lah...</i>

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:17.920
<i>Shooby-dooby—</i>

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.540
<i>Lah-lah-lah-lahlah-lah—</i>

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:20.290
Don't try and stand out!

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:29.460
Why does everybody get mad at me

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:31.320
when I try to have fun singing and dancing?

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:38.190
Blame yourself, not others.

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:41.910
Don't give up before you try.

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:49.050
I'm hungry.

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:51.990
May I have a moment?

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:56.400
You're the one who's

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:59.280
trying to stand out 
everywhere she goes, right?

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:01.290
I didn't mean to, but...

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:05.770
I just wanted to sing and dance.

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:11.660
Her!  Like her!

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:13.020
I wanted to be like her!

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:14.890
Oh, Rosary.

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.700
Rosary-san?

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:18.830
You want to be like her?

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:20.690
Yes, I do!

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:22.900
I see. So that's it.

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:27.010
Finally, someone who understands.

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:30.780
Um, do you think I could?

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:38.320
Is it impossible?

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:40.280
I don't think so.

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:43.880
If you leave it to me.

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:48.790
Estoir Productions?

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:50.080
Manager?

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:55.220
Yes, so I'm sure I can make you like Rosary!

00:06:55.990 --> 00:07:00.970
But I'm not good at singing 
and dancing with others.

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:03.230
You don't have to be.

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:06.240
You've got something that 
nobody else can get,

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:09.150
no matter how hard they practice.

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:12.240
God-given talent.

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:15.280
So you'll be fine.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:16.330
Really?

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:17.620
Yes.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:20.720
In exchange, can you 
promise me you won't say

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:24.070
that you can't do it 
or you're giving up.

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:25.070
Yes!

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:26.300
Then the contract is complete.

00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:29.210
Now, let's get started.

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:32.950
<i>Don't ever let food go to waste.</i>

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:36.080
Wait!

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.950
Is it all right if I eat first?

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:40.990
Certainly.

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:47.260
Come in.

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:49.050
Excuse me, president.

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:50.920
This is Ieyasu, the one I 
spoke to you about.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:53.380
Oh, you're Ieyasu.

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:55.850
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:57.330
Likewise.

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:00.580
Here, sign this.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:03.080
<b>Contract</b>

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:03.080
Contract?

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:06.540
You know, you just made 
that promise with me.

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:11.100
Then sign here if you would.

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:12.090
Okay.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:15.430
<b>Name:</b>

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:15.430
Tokugawa Ieyasu

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:15.430
Okay, work hard now.

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:17.040
Right!

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:18.460
We'll get started right away.

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:20.670
What are we starting?

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:21.550
Lessons.

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:23.180
Singing and dance practice.

00:08:23.180 --> 00:08:25.140
All right!

00:08:25.140 --> 00:08:27.030
If you'll excuse me!

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:31.330
God-given talent, huh?

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:35.450
It's finally time for 
singing and dance lessons!

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:38.580
I'll do my best!

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:57.940
Enunciate!

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:03.050
It hurts!

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:05.020
It doesn't hurt.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:11.610
From the diaphragm.

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:16.700
No, no.  From your diaphragm.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:21.930
Try harder!

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:24.180
Just like I thought.

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:27.550
She has something special.

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:29.530
Yeah, you're right.

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:32.710
But she's the one person 
who doesn't see it.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:42.600
I'm exhausted.

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:48.060
But I gotta keep it up!

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:56.570
Oranges            Cake             Chocolate            Chips

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:06.950
What's wrong with having a goal in life?!

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:08.620
No, no!

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:11.750
Wrong, wrong, wrong!  Completely wrong!

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:15.550
Your words aren't reaching 
me here at all!

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:18.430
Don't waste my time, seriously.

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:20.560
And don't think being an idol is easy.

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:22.470
If you think you can make it without effort,

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.190
then you are sorely mistaken!

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:26.980
I'm not wasting your time.

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:29.310
I'm not!

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:31.190
Hey, wait.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:33.190
Your lesson isn't over!

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:55.590
Ieyasu?

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:58.100
I just gave her a little 
bit of a hard time.

00:10:58.100 --> 00:10:59.780
I'm sorry.

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:03.670
But I hope she truly understands

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:06.330
that she made me angry.

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:07.810
Yes.

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:09.350
I'll bring her back.

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:15.900
I can't do it.

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:18.330
In exchange, can you 
promise me you won't say

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:21.530
that you can't do it 
or you're giving up.

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:27.020
No, I can't do it.

00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:29.370
I can't do this.

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:32.610
I can't be like Rosary-san.

00:11:32.610 --> 00:11:34.290
That wasn't the deal.

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:38.630
You promised you wouldn't say that.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:42.030
But... I can't...

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:43.980
I want to show you something.

00:11:43.980 --> 00:11:46.970
But I've had enough.

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:49.780
I can't make it as an idol.

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:51.560
I understand.

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:54.730
However, you can still quit 
after you see it, okay?

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:02.530
Take a look.

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:19.800
I'm the one who arranged her debut.

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:25.710
I've seen lots of girls 
who wanted to be idols.

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:28.220
Song, dance, acting...

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.700
Lots of them had talent.

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:34.550
But, in the end, the only 
one who made it through...

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:37.380
was her.

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:41.780
So I can't do it, can I?

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.170
After all, I'm not amazing like her.

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:48.330
It wasn't talent that 
got her this far.

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:52.890
If it was, she would've 
gone even further.

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:57.380
But out of all the girls I've met,

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.770
she was the only one who never said

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:02.050
she couldn't do it or that she gave up.

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:05.130
She was the only one.

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:24.530
Can I ask you something?

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:28.310
Why did you approach me that day?

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:29.670
Hmm.

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:33.800
I suppose, because I felt you 
had some kind of regal bearing.

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:35.910
Regal bearing?

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:41.210
<i>The cause of your own 
destruction is within you.</i>

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:47.300
I'm sorry.

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:51.600
Let's remake that promise, okay?

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:54.810
Okay.  Then one more time.

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:58.050
Can you promise me you won't say

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:01.620
that you can't do it 
or you're giving up.

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:03.320
Yeah.

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:05.660
Then let's head back.

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:06.780
Okay!

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:10.120
Good morning.

00:14:10.560 --> 00:14:13.030
Um, hi.

00:14:13.030 --> 00:14:14.600
Who are these people?

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:17.040
Your backup dancers.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.620
Backup dancers...

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:20.610
Nice to meet you.

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:22.640
Yeah, nice to meet you.

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:25.210
So, on our schedule for today,

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:27.590
we're going to have dance practice...

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:28.250
Does she not remember?

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.440
Looks like she forgot.

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:31.830
Looks like it.

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:32.720
...will that be okay?

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:35.530
Yeah, I'll do my best.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:57.200
<b><i>There's something hidden in you that pulls me</i></b>

00:14:58.220 --> 00:15:03.170
<b><i>Every time we pass by I want to see you</i></b>

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:10.260
<b><i>I want to let my feelings play like music</i></b>

00:15:10.740 --> 00:15:16.550
<b><i>I feel like I can go anywhere</i></b>

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:23.290
<b><i>Come on, I want you to hold me right now!</i></b>

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:30.690
<b><i>I can't say that, so please just know!  
I'm going in circles around you</i></b>

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:37.010
<b><i>Loving so serious, no love ever stops.</i></b>

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:42.890
<b><i>I want to accept that I lose sight of things.</i></b>

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:49.990
<b><i>That's right, dance me so glorious, 
In a world we've never seen</i></b>

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:57.250
<b><i>We can test our love again and again, 
as we search for the answer</i></b>

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:06.730
Ieyasu-kun was a bigger 
hit than we expected

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:09.480
That God-given talent you spoke of

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:12.290
is becoming more and more polished.

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:13.350
Yes.

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:15.980
And I just received a call,

00:16:15.980 --> 00:16:18.990
that she'll be starring in that movie.

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:22.550
Wasn't Rosary supposed 
to take that role?

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:25.250
The director insisted.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:26.590
I see.

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:29.180
So we have a new queen now.

00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:31.090
You must have mixed thoughts on this.

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:33.760
It's not something that can be helped.

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:37.760
Tokugawa Ieyasu-sama

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:37.760
What do I do?  What do I do?

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.770
I'm starring with Rosary-san!

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:43.770
And I finally get to meet her today!

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:46.250
What are we gonna talk about?

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:48.870
What should I say?

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:52.190
I hope we get along and 
that we can be friends!

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:55.700
First I have to introduce myself!

00:16:55.700 --> 00:17:00.700
Rosary-sama

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:00.700
Yes?

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:04.430
It's really her voice!

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:05.930
I'm so nervous.

00:17:05.930 --> 00:17:06.840
Who's there?

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:09.890
I-I-It's Ieyasu.

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:11.560
May I come in?

00:17:11.560 --> 00:17:12.550
Go ahead.

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:15.220
Thank you!

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:20.720
I-I hope we can work well together!

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:24.780
I became an idol because I admired you!

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:28.230
And now we get to work together...

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:31.170
It's like a dream!  I'm... I'm...

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:34.180
What am I saying?

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:36.700
Is that sarcasm?

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:46.680
What?

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:48.500
Did you come to laugh at me?

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:52.030
No, I don't want to do that.

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:55.510
<b>Weekly Bust</b>

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:55.510
New Idol Queen Ieyasu Overtakes Rosary

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:55.510
Um, these.

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:58.170
I... didn't know at all!

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:01.430
You don't have to pretend to 
be an idol in front of me.

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:05.130
You're only here because 
that manager said he'd

00:18:05.130 --> 00:18:06.770
make you an idol, right?

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:10.020
I don't understand...

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:12.550
Didn't you know?

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:16.280
You can't have two top 
idols at one time.

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:20.530
Eventually, somebody will overtake you.

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:24.350
Even if there's nobody like you,

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:29.020
who's knocking me out of the top spot.

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:34.880
It's cruel, but you can't freeze time.

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:38.300
It hurts, but you have to know when

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:39.980
it's time to call it quits.

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:44.310
That's the rule of this world.

00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:49.310
Not that my words are 
reaching you, I suppose.

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:52.470
I just wanted to be like you...

00:18:52.470 --> 00:18:54.740
You want to be pathetic like me?

00:18:58.050 --> 00:18:59.570
No you don't.

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:07.990
<i>The person who makes 
the most people happy</i>

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:10.130
<i>is the one who flourishes the most.</i>

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:18.840
Then you have to follow your own path.

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:20.590
What?

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:22.220
I...

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:27.390
I'm going to keep on being the top idol!

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:31.400
I see.  If you can...

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:34.500
I don't think it's possible, though.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:41.510
I see.

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:45.290
I came from the Sengoku 
world to this world...

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:46.970
So you remembered.

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:51.730
Ieyasu-dono.

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:05.340
Ieyasu!

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:10.900
Nobunaga-san!

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:12.890
It's been a long time, Ieyasu.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:15.520
Thanks to you becoming one 
of these "idol" whatevers,

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:17.360
it was easy to find you.

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:20.950
Nobunaga-san, why...

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:24.620
To get back to our world, 
we need the power

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:26.490
of the Secret Treasures.

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:29.910
We can go back? From here to there?

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:32.540
Provided you get lots 
of Secret Treasures.

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:36.040
Then do you...

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:41.170
Ieyasu, I'm here to take 
your Secret Treasure.

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:46.570
If you don't want me to...

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:47.520
All right.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:50.930
I'll give you my secret treasure.

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:52.360
Are you sure?

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:54.900
You won't be able to return after that.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:56.380
I don't mind.

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:58.570
I'll stay here in this world.

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:02.540
And fight to the end as an idol here,

00:21:03.550 --> 00:21:04.570
and rule!

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:08.810
All right.

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:10.950
If that's what you want, 
then I'll take it.

00:21:51.440 --> 00:21:52.620
Ieyasu?

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:54.710
Nobunaga-san?

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:57.470
Your secret treasure is mine now.

00:21:58.030 --> 00:21:59.060
Bye.

00:21:59.060 --> 00:22:00.460
Nobunaga-san?

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:01.630
What?

00:22:02.480 --> 00:22:03.760
Good luck in your fight.

00:22:05.060 --> 00:22:06.470
You, too.

00:23:46.310 --> 00:23:48.650
The next story is about 
Naoe Kanetsugu-san,

00:23:48.650 --> 00:23:49.850
the Pure Love Angel!

00:23:49.850 --> 00:23:53.010
A romance with Kenshin-san!  
I'm so jealous!

00:23:53.010 --> 00:23:56.040
Next time on Sengoku 
Collection: "Pure Angel."

00:23:56.040 --> 00:23:59.940
If the Cuckoo won't watch, 
wait until it does!
